  "description": "Step into Junkyard Garage Simulator, where every rusted wreck tells a story and every repair brings a forgotten legend back to life. Take control of your own fully equipped garage and immerse yourself in the art of car restoration. From scrapyards to showrooms, every vehicle is a challenge waiting to be mastered.\n\nGame Features:\n • Inspect & Diagnose Every Detail: Rotate the camera freely, examine vehicles from every angle, and use tools to identify missing or damaged components before starting repairs.\n • Repair, Restore, or Scrap: Fix engines, brakes, and suspension, restore worn parts through interactive mini-games, or scrap components for partial value.\n • Customization & Tuning: Modify body panels, improve performance, and apply visual upgrades to increase vehicle value.\n • Test Drives & Quality Checks: Take restored cars on a test track to evaluate handling and ensure everything works properly.\n • Explore & Discover Hidden Stories: Search scrapyards and abandoned locations to find rare vehicles, hidden items, and mysterious traces.\n\nBecome a master restorer, revive automotive history, and turn rusted relics into priceless masterpieces. Every car you save is more than a restoration — it’s a story brought back to life.",
